message: >-
  Please cite the PMC-PaIR Data Descriptor, the PMC-PaIR dataset, this software
  and PMC-Patients, as listed under references. The code, documentation,
  configuration, prompts, examples and tests are released under the MIT license,
  and the data files under CC BY 4.0. LICENSING.md lists the paths of each class.
